        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "Listen to this stretch for word length rather than sound: the runs come in the short, repeating shapes a root-and-pattern morphology produces, and they fall where a reader of an unknown but real language would expect breaks. Under the cipher and hoax readings the same seconds are an artefact of the encoding; here they are speech.",
